@startuml UCD-system
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam wrapWidth 190
skinparam dpi 180
title UCD-system: Aircon Retailer Workload Management System (M2)
' Traces: UC-01 to UC-05, UC-07 to UC-13, UC-15 to UC-18; SRS v4.1; use-case list v3.1.
' Sources: DEC-17, DEC-18, DEC-45, DEC-88, DEC-91, DEC-96-98; Brief R1-R11; M2-Brief §1, §5.4.
' UC-06 and UC-14 are Withdrawn (DEC-91). UC-02 is standalone (no <<extend>>).
' Email Service and SMS Gateway are non-human <<system>> actors drawn as boxes (DEC-88).
' Arrows from an actor point to the use case it starts; arrows to a <<system>> actor show the system calling it.
' HR system and van vendor are not actors: the Manager uploads their CSV files (DEC-74).
left to right direction
skinparam linetype polyline
skinparam nodesep 25
skinparam ranksep 60
skinparam usecaseBackgroundColor white
skinparam usecaseBorderColor black
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor white
skinparam rectangleBorderColor black
skinparam actorStyle stickman

actor "User\n{abstract}" as User
actor Manager
actor Staff
actor Driver
actor Technician
actor "IT Administrator" as ITA
actor Clock

User <|-- Manager
User <|-- Staff
User <|-- ITA
Staff <|-- Driver
Staff <|-- Technician

rectangle "Aircon Retailer Workload Management System" {
 usecase "UC-01 Log In/out" as U1
 usecase "UC-02 Reset Password" as U2
 usecase "UC-03 Create User Account" as U3
 usecase "UC-04 Manage User Access" as U4
 usecase "UC-05 Manage Job" as U5
 usecase "UC-07 Allocate Jobs /\nSet Weekly Schedule\n--\nextension points:\nCompare Staff" as U7
 usecase "UC-08 Compare Staff" as U8
 usecase "UC-09 Decide Job\nRejection Request" as U9
 usecase "UC-10 View Manpower\nDashboard" as U10
 usecase "UC-11 Set Availability" as U11
 usecase "UC-12 Submit Job\nRejection Request" as U12
 usecase "UC-13 View My Assignments\nand Workload" as U13
 usecase "UC-15 Notify Staff" as U15
 usecase "UC-16 Upload CSV" as U16
 usecase "UC-17 Update Roster\nand Hours" as U17
 usecase "UC-18 Set Standby\nPreference" as U18
}

rectangle "<<system>>\nEmail Service" as Email
rectangle "<<system>>\nSMS Gateway" as SMS

User --> U1
User --> U2
ITA --> U3
ITA --> U4
Manager --> U5
Manager --> U7
Manager --> U9
Manager --> U10
Manager --> U16
Manager --> U17
Staff --> U11
Staff --> U12
Staff --> U13
Technician --> U18
Clock --> U9

U8 .> U7 : <<extend>>\n(Compare Staff)\n{Manager selects 1-3 Staff}
U5 ..> U15 : <<include>>
U7 ..> U15 : <<include>>
U9 ..> U15 : <<include>>
U17 ..> U15 : <<include>>

U1 --> Email
U2 --> Email
U3 --> Email
U15 --> Email
U15 --> SMS

legend bottom
Clock: time event that lapses a still-Pending Job Rejection Request at Job start (UC-09).
The daily 12-month purge (FR-58) is a Clock event with no use case.
UC-18 requests a provisional pick; UC-07 confirms after capacity checks and notifies via UC-15.
UC-17 includes direct Standby Jobs, per-Job replacements and Active Hours corrections.
Withdrawn: UC-06 Manage Vans and Workshop Servicing; UC-14 Complete Job (DEC-91).
endlegend
@enduml
